This project downloads the Amazon QuickSight Embedding SDK at deploy time
(amazon-quicksight-embedding-sdk) and serves it from the Lambda. That SDK is
distributed by Amazon under the Apache License 2.0 and is NOT part of this
repository (it is fetched during deploy and is gitignored). See:

  https://github.com/awslabs/amazon-quicksight-embedding-sdk
  https://www.npmjs.com/package/amazon-quicksight-embedding-sdk

No other third-party code is bundled in this repository.
